  "patthana9.16:0.1": "",
  "patthana9.16:0.2": "",
  "patthana9.16:0.3": "100-2. Saraṇaduka-vedanādittikāni Paccayacatukkaṃ Hetupaccayo ",
  "patthana9.16:1.0": "86. ",
  "patthana9.16:1.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ nasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ nadukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ naadukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana9.16:2.1": "",
  "patthana9.16:3.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ navipākaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana9.16:4.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ navipākadhammadhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana9.16:5.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ nanevavipākanavipākadhammadhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana9.16:6.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ naupādinnupādāniyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana9.16:7.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ naanupādinnupādāniyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana9.16:8.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ naanupādinnaanupādāniyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. "
}
